"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:de06faf4-6d56-426b-abbc-e64f86de3951\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:de06faf4-6d56-426b-abbc-e64f86de3951\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a chest in <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur%27s_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arfur's Basement\">Arfur's Basement</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;361&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-990</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Starts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_the_Suspicious_Toys\" title=\"Investigate the Suspicious Toys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigate the Suspicious Toys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_the_Suspicious_Toys\" title=\"Investigate the Suspicious Toys\">Investigate the Suspicious Toys</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Arfur, package still waiting for you at <a href=\"/wiki/Felogyr%27s_Fireworks\" title=\"Felogyr's Fireworks\">Felogyr's</a>. You'd better not be late again or we'll start to wonder if you're really as committed as you claim to be. Pick it up, put it in the teddy bears, make the donation. It couldn't be simpler, really. If it's still here this time tomorrow, we'll stuff you with it. As you well know, we've plenty to spare.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202758\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1795/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28622/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7962/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935358/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.311      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.311      1 -total\n 59.81%   27.699      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.64%   24.843     19 Template:Trim\n 34.00%   15.744      1 Template:PageSeo\n 33.83%   15.668      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.84%   11.965      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.88%   10.134      1 Template:CharLink\n 21.26%    9.847      2 Template:Uid\n 20.57%    9.524      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12846-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202758 and revision id 364854. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}